 * at each instant, while a worker is free and some task is ready, the
 * ready task with the greatest priority (ties broken by ascending name)
 * starts on the free worker with the smallest index; time then advances
 * to the next instant a worker frees up. Returns `{ logs, makespan }`
 * where `logs[i]` is the ordered list of `{ name, start, finish }` worker
 * `i` ran.
